# First element of the `data:` LIST. Splitting the ABox over two files
# is what exercises `manifest::OneOrMany::Many`; the individual typing
# lives here and the property assertion in allfields-data-b.ttl, so a
# case that loaded only one of them cannot satisfy instance_of_expr.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix ex:  <http://example.org/> .

ex:i1 a owl:NamedIndividual, ex:B .
